{"id":"6dbaa6eab4e3857b","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-random.md","title":"Random Real","display":"thm-random — Random Real","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-random","aliases":["58-thm-random"],"display":"thm-random — Random Real","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-random.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-random — Random Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17b0691a6d971aa3\" href=\"?note=17b0691a6d971aa3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-random.md\">../batch08/58-df-random.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\">\\(\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\)</span>（随机 forcing，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17b0691a6d971aa3\" href=\"?note=17b0691a6d971aa3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-random.md\">../batch08/58-df-random.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot r\">\\(\\dot r\\)</span>（典范随机实数名称）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>（ground model）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check x\">\\(\\check x\\)</span>（ground-model 对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的典范名称）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\Vdash\\dot r\\in2^\\omega\\right)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in(2^\\omega)^V\\;\n\\left(\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\Vdash\\dot r\\ne\\check x\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\Vdash\\dot r\\in2^\\omega\\right)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in(2^\\omega)^V\\;\n\\left(\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\Vdash\\dot r\\ne\\check x\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot r\\notin V\">\\(\\dot r\\notin V\\)</span>” 不是扩张对象语言中的合法原子式；新颖性已展开为与每个 ground-model 实数的典范名称都不相等。</li>\n<li>随机 forcing 满足 c.c.c.，保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 及其平稳子集。</li>\n<li>它是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>-bounding，因而不会添加支配所有 ground-model 函数的实数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-random.md","status":"resolved","id":"17b0691a6d971aa3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-random.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-random.md","status":"resolved","id":"17b0691a6d971aa3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}$（随机 forcing，见 [[../batch08/58-df-random.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot r","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\check x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\Vdash\\dot r\\in2^\\omega\\right)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in(2^\\omega)^V\\;\n\\left(\\mathbb B_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\Vdash\\dot r\\ne\\check x\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\dot r\\notin V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1070,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4384","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-random.md|58-thm-random]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["17b0691a6d971aa3","46b2495f214783c3"]}